= The April Theses

On 16 April Lenin arrived in Petrograd in a sealed train that had crossed Germany. At the Finland Station he told the crowd that the revolution had not ended, and the next day he put out his "April Theses": no support for the Provisional Government, all power to the soviets, an end to the war, the confiscation of the landlords' estates.

Even most Bolsheviks thought the theses mad. Plekhanov called them "delirium". Many Bolsheviks in the provinces still work in joint committees with the Mensheviks, and Kamenev's wing hopes to remain on speaking terms with the other socialists.

- @dismiss: Dismiss the theses. This is anarchism, not Marxism.
- @unity: Invite Kamenev's wing to a unity conference.
- @sr_denounce: Chernov replies: the Bolsheviks have copied our land programme and spoiled the rest.
- @sr_land: Offer the Bolshevik left a joint programme on the land.
- @lsr_welcome: Welcome the land and peace points, and keep our distance.
- @lsr_reject: Reject the theses: the peasants will not be led by a party that does not know them.

@dismiss
view-if: player_party = 'menshevik'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {bolshevik: 2, rel_bol: -3});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 1);
!}

Sukhanov remarked that Lenin would be left alone, outside the revolution. This was an error: Lenin was outside the Soviet's consensus, and so was the whole population.

@unity
view-if: player_party = 'menshevik'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 8, bolshevik: -3});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -2);
Q.bol_unity = 1;
!}

A unity conference was held with the local Bolsheviks in Tiflis, Moscow and a number of provincial towns. Lenin ignored the results. Kamenev's wing, pleased with the contact, has become more critical of him.

@sr_denounce
view-if: player_party = 'sr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {bolshevik: 1, rel_bol: -4});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2, middle: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 1, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

Chernov wrote, in the party's paper, that Lenin's land programme was lifted from the SRs word for word, and that the rest of the theses were anarchism. It is true on both counts. It is also an advertisement for the programme.

@sr_land
view-if: player_party = 'sr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 6, bolshevik: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 8);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 2, -4);
Q.bol_unity = 1;
!}

Some Bolsheviks have come to the Left SRs with a proposal for a common platform on the land. Lenin, who calls the SRs petty bourgeois, has not objected. The Right SRs are scandalised.

@lsr_welcome
view-if: player_party = 'lsr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: 8, bolshevik: 2});
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: 2, peasants: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 3, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 6);
!}

Lenin's theses say about the land and the war what the Left SRs have been saying for two months. We have said so, and added that the Bolsheviks have nobody in the villages. The SR leaders say that the left wing is flirting with anarchism.

@lsr_reject
view-if: player_party = 'lsr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {rel_bol: -4, rel_ally: 3});
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 1, -3);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 4);
!}

Spiridonova said that the Bolsheviks were a party of cities and of pamphlets, and that the peasants would not follow men who had never met one. She was right, in the long run.
